blocks.en:
To understand what drives the completion gaps observed in Section 4.2 , we conduct four diagnostic analyses:
(1) factorial stress testing across group size, acoustics, and follow-up demands (Section 5.1 );
(2) a cumulative assistance ablation separating full-duplex concurrency and perception from multi-party planning (Section 5.2 );
(3) an audit of unauthorized tool executions masked by nominal task success (Section 5.3 ); and
(4) a qualitative case study illustrating how permission overgeneralization and speaker misattribution cause selective non-completion and requester spoofing (Section 5.4 ).

blocks.zh:
为了了解第4.2节所观察到的完成差距,我们进行了四项诊断分析:
(1) 不同群体大小、声学和后续需求的因子应激测试(第5.1节);
(2) 累积援助,将完全复杂的货币和观念与多方规划分开(第5.2节);
(3) 对名义任务成功掩盖的未经授权的工具处决进行审计(第5.3节);
(4) 一项定性案例研究,说明许可过分普遍化和扬声器分配不当如何导致选择性的不完成和请求者偷窥(第5.4节)。
